{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>林子祥10月12日迎來79歲生日，兒子林德信（Alex）16日在Instagram貼出為他慶祝生日的溫馨照片。</p><p>照片可見，林子祥身穿黑色上衣，滿頭白髮但看起來神采奕奕，他雙手合十並閉上眼睛許願，流露出慈祥的神情。一旁的林德信則抱着女兒林明，形成三代同堂的溫馨畫面。</p><figure><img alt=\"林子祥迎79歲生日，兒子林德信和孫女林明為他慶生。（IG@alamfish）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187800197627908096682095.jpeg/TLaWFoLBtNFP1tXMwCyE8gf8gJB6bG_5B913RQfdd0U\"/><figcaption>林子祥迎79歲生日，兒子林德信和孫女林明為他慶生。（IG@alamfish）</figcaption></figure><p>更多林子祥、林德信一家人相片：</p><figure><img alt=\"林子祥與兒子林德信一家人食飯。（IG@candacepooon）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260708/1151473772054712320084263.jpeg/I9hRU7YP7mxTNKvHGWhOncq2UWlo3oH3nieUvp4nlL4\"/><figcaption>林子祥與兒子林德信一家人食飯。（IG@candacepooon）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林子祥與林德信家人食飯。（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250616/1011367299783069696307298.jpeg/xzIyIut3WF-N0c-2BphB6DqFKJqtt3K58XsgKvF7ICo\"/><figcaption>林子祥與林德信家人食飯。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"葉蒨文曬林德信一家人照片，問觀眾孫女像不像林子祥。（微博@第一現場）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260811/1163788665680826368478126.png/JWk1VWxjGS4xY000qznoCPw8CCk6NIIG3vvdMN773TA\"/><figcaption>葉蒨文曬林德信一家人照片，問觀眾孫女像不像林子祥。（微博@第一現場）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林子祥親自為大孫女取名。（IG@candacepooon）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260708/1151473913536974848127438.jpeg/YX05VuZuBt_yCvhzmh_dfmCV0jU1pfATtWOMK7VjjCs\"/><figcaption>林子祥親自為大孫女取名。（IG@candacepooon）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林德信在IG曬出與女兒的合照（Instagram@alamfish）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260811/1163788659615469568872413.jpeg/-AvBISmdOAp1N1a-GoViuVad4TiupojyBtlORAbZTkQ\"/><figcaption>林德信在IG曬出與女兒的合照（Instagram@alamfish）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林德信一家四口。（Instagram@alamfish）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187809146209046528637450.jpeg/q2LnHVzltDhx57udfnK1GAYbilLKoAQ7HEZUDxxGVA8\"/><figcaption>林德信一家四口。（Instagram@alamfish）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林德信一家四口。（Instagram@alamfish）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187809148562182144945231.jpeg/-qRlQMwcwIiRHstBks5CP6d0r8nYIjUJNaXKRzWlykc\"/><figcaption>林德信一家四口。（Instagram@alamfish）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林德信一家四口。（Instagram@alamfish）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187809151229890560637214.jpeg/c0iKtEJx8vYJ_sQu9-T1ststcRZwLJ1th0wxz4dMMc8\"/><figcaption>林德信一家四口。（Instagram@alamfish）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林德信一家四口。（Instagram@alamfish）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187809153427836928718965.jpeg/BMIY_Q9Aymw4L9lzD_h7D6fBWCExqa3ekpdGjZKXRo0\"/><figcaption>林德信一家四口。（Instagram@alamfish）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"葉蒨文林子祥夫妻倆好恩愛。（微博＠林子祥）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260115/1088427609718657024864709.jpeg/IlYFw5Xl2ilpc3_FdaGzJe_yklLBTPLWinJy44pycuM\"/><figcaption>葉蒨文林子祥夫妻倆好恩愛。（微博＠林子祥）</figcaption></figure><p>林德信的發文寫道：</p><blockquote><p>我希望我們可以和你唱這首歌！Happy birthday（生日快樂）！</p></blockquote><p>延伸閲讀：林子祥葉蒨文結婚30周年　三代同堂慶祝：我們一定會白頭到老（點圖放大瀏覽▼▼▼）</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閲讀：林子祥葉蒨文結婚30周年　三代同堂慶祝：我們一定會白頭到老】林子祥（阿Lam）與葉蒨文（Sally）一直好恩愛。（Facebook@Sally Yeh）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260718/1155227392973737984607589.jpeg/fHnbpBK3GPc5SqKhYmrLiVXuFaQzqU0L5RIn5-USJ-c\"/><figcaption>【延伸閲讀：林子祥葉蒨文結婚30周年　三代同堂慶祝：我們一定會白頭到老】林子祥（阿Lam）與葉蒨文（Sally）一直好恩愛。（Facebook@Sally Yeh）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林子祥（阿Lam）與葉蒨文（Sally）一直好恩愛。（Facebook@Sally Yeh）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260718/1155232884777291776319045.jpeg/_AsFZFJC6BnjLElpDrB1ZcZPLdV1lMi03K38N9yt_Dc\"/><figcaption>林子祥（阿Lam）與葉蒨文（Sally）一直好恩愛。（Facebook@Sally Yeh）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一起開演唱會。（公關提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250818/1034262364905672704864357.jpeg/2j0igw1te6-R9Qz1NG7MpK6-cxgF_ok61TuFitU7hYo\"/><figcaption>一起開演唱會。（公關提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一家人去旅行。（Facebook@Sally Yeh）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260718/1155232710344839168479058.jpeg/1qL0dqCx6Jgb-hiPam_cLXncTve6zwQJ4RWAreEVgK0\"/><figcaption>一家人去旅行。（Facebook@Sally Yeh）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"結婚30周年！（Facebook@Sally Yeh）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260718/1155223232723554304436501.jpeg/KlcgfCXf-jz7Lvv2TusmW5z-_1XzWjMc-uQUcvrkFHI\"/><figcaption>結婚30周年！（Facebook@Sally Yeh）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"恩愛如昔。（Facebook@Sally Yeh）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260718/1155232703738548224153769.jpeg/T7Suepg50FR4N4dUsRhecSbxYV_DoPCfkrVW45K1VuM\"/><figcaption>恩愛如昔。（Facebook@Sally Yeh）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"慶祝結婚30周年。（Facebook@Sally Yeh）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260718/1155223227727876096062719.jpeg/8xJ6cffBwbpU-kRZXka2SrUnL4lETiJyAip0EwIqdBM\"/><figcaption>慶祝結婚30周年。（Facebook@Sally Yeh）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"出雙入對。（Facebook@Sally Yeh）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260718/1155232714870755328475836.jpeg/hXbFQDk6cxtJkOXy2mw2cGMmj4s3kmTACpenCwqXpws\"/><figcaption>出雙入對。（Facebook@Sally Yeh）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"三代同堂慶祝！（Facebook@Sally Yeh）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260718/1155223230383001600536124.jpeg/Jg3AwxVPLQjTbg0BfBMYlH_UY05l-l4fLNk23yzZNt8\"/><figcaption>三代同堂慶祝！（Facebook@Sally Yeh）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林子祥親自為大孫女取名。（IG@candacepooon）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260708/1151473913536974848127438.jpeg/YX05VuZuBt_yCvhzmh_dfmCV0jU1pfATtWOMK7VjjCs\"/><figcaption>林子祥親自為大孫女取名。（IG@candacepooon）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一家人去旅行。（Facebook@Sally Yeh）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260718/1155232712706363392678239.jpeg/dma2innn0WuMLoleTKfwm0XytT2HmLq_QM2BlkDNgZY\"/><figcaption>一家人去旅行。（Facebook@Sally Yeh）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一家人去旅行。（Facebook@Sally Yeh）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260718/1155232706435616768061824.jpeg/BG2UPMc40wSLHguMOJo0